## Related Rust Examples to Study

- **Inter-canister calls** (bounded-wait, unbounded-wait, retries): [[inter-canister-calls](https://github.com/dfinity/examples/blob/master/rust/inter-canister-calls/README.md)]
- **Parallel calls** (useful for launching both token transfers simultaneously): [[parallel_calls](https://github.com/dfinity/examples/blob/master/rust/parallel_calls/README.md)]
